---
description: Mandatory PR workflow — never push directly to main
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `docs/agents/GIT_WORKFLOW.md` before committing or pushing.

Hard rules:
- Never push feature work directly to `main`
- Always use `feature/...` branches + pull requests
- Wait for Quality + Security CI checks to pass before merge
- Never skip hooks with `--no-verify` unless the user explicitly asks
- Never commit `.env`, `.env.local`, or API keys
